<title>GERMANY: Forwarder Militzer &amp; Muench opens Belgrade office.</title>
<headline>Forwarder Militzer &amp; Muench opens Belgrade office.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>German freight forwarder Militzer &amp; Muench GmbH said it has expanded its eastern Europe network to Serbia.</p>
<p>The new M&amp;M office in Belgrade is managed by the company's Bulgarian subsidiary, a company statement said. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
